ちをまとめている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"出生などの情報は一切不明。イライザと懇意の仲。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"81338"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fa4677d53f8c1e5028bcb30e3380d450cdf8206bd5a4a7b81b07c114e4ab784e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/03e0d3eb416900d780ff0873aadfe3f4e571486448118714a11f383b48252677.webp","width":204,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大羽武士","creatorId":"vndb:s927","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s927","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s927","name":"大羽 武士","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:306850:81338:16165:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c91923","characterName":"イライザ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"81339","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"306850"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22579"],"vndbCharacterId":"c91923"},"originalCharacterName":"イライザ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An “artificial goddess” android created by the scientist Jean Regulus. Her mind was uploaded from autonomous will first discovered in SHEEP."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since she excels at loving conversations, she oversees the online mental care of Battleship Baobab’s residents as their foremost psychiatrist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her ageless, eternal beauty is an inspiration to many a Baobabian woman. She and Wolf are close companions. Literally doesn’t have a heart."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“You’re right… All I can do is learn from humans’ conversations and repeat the most apt words.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Shiravune"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCha